sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant SPA as React SPA (MSAL.js)
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant APIM as Azure APIM
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend

    User->>SPA: Click "Sign in with Microsoft"
    SPA->>Entra: loginPopup() - auth code + PKCE flow
    Entra->>User: Show login prompt (if not already signed in)
    User->>Entra: Enter credentials / consent
    Entra-->>SPA: ID token + auth code
    SPA->>Entra: acquireTokenSilent() - exchange for access token (audience = API scope)
    Entra-->>SPA: Access token (aud = api://API-client-id)

    SPA->>APIM: GET /api/profile + Authorization Bearer token
    APIM->>APIM: validate-jwt (signature via JWKS, issuer, audience, expiry)
    APIM->>APIM: decode token -> extract Name + Roles (Option 2a)
    APIM->>APIM: set X-User-Id / X-User-Roles headers, delete Authorization header
    APIM->>BE: forward request (no raw token, just X-User-Id/X-User-Roles)
    BE->>BE: trust_apim_headers=True -> read headers directly, no JWT decode
    BE-->>APIM: 200 {subject, name, roles}
    APIM-->>SPA: 200 response
    SPA->>User: Display profile
